{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2021-11-03 16:30:00', 'title': 'AMEREN ANNOUNCES THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': "ST. LOUIS, NOV. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THIRD QUARTER 2021 NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $425 MILLION, OR $1.65 PER DILUTED SHARE, COMPARED TO THIRD QUARTER 2020 NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $367 MILLION, OR $1.47 PER DILUTED SHARE. THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS REFLECTED EARNINGS ON INCREASED INFRASTRUCTURE INVESTMENTS MADE ACROSS ALL BUSINESS SEGMENTS DRIVEN BY STRONG EXECUTION OF THE COMPANY'S STRATEGY."}